  "response_format": {
    "type": "json_schema",
    "json_schema": {
      "name": "simple_string_response",
      "strict": true,
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "result": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "result"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Also running the original request against qwen3.6:35b works fine:

